Package: hf.econometrics
Type: Package
Title: High-Frequency Econometrics: Jump Tests and Noise-Robust Volatility
    Estimators
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Danial", "Saef", email = "danial.saef@hu-berlin.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implementations of high-frequency econometric methods that
    follow their original sources equation by equation: the Lee and Mykland
    (2012) <doi:10.1016/j.jeconom.2012.03.001> noise-robust jump test; the
    Ait-Sahalia and Jacod (2009, 2011, 2012) jump, finite-activity and
    jump-activity statistics; the Ait-Sahalia, Jacod and Li (2012)
    <doi:10.1016/j.jeconom.2012.01.007> pre-averaged jump test; and
    pre-averaging estimators of integrated variance (Jacod et al. 2009;
    Podolskij and Vetter 2009; Jacod, Podolskij and Vetter 2010; Hautsch and
    Podolskij 2013). Options and results are typed 'S7' objects. Reusable
    utilities for regular-grid sampling and data cleaning are included; batch
    processing lives in a separate 'targets' pipeline outside the package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
